{{!
    @template local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_plate

    An hour of the page of the channel as a plate: the hour, written in its place, with half an hour less and more. The
    field goes before the two buttons, so that a button, sent last, is the value PHP keeps.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name, value - The setting and the hour it has.
    * label, caption - What it is, for a screen reader, and above the plate (empty, nothing).
    * less, noless, more, nomore - Half an hour less and more, and whether there is none.
    * action - Optional, where its buttons go (the card they come back to), from the context around it.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "reviewfrom", "value": "08:00", "label": "From", "caption": "From", "less": "07:30", "noless": false,
        "more": "08:30", "nomore": false
    }
}}
<span class="mrd-placa">{{#caption}}<span class="mrd-placa-t" aria-hidden="true">{{.}}</span>{{/caption}}<input type="time" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}" aria-label="{{label}}" data-solo><button type="submit" class="mrd-menos" name="{{name}}" value="{{less}}" aria-label="{{#str}} channel:earlier, local_oksigeniamarandu, {{less}} {{/str}}"{{#noless}} disabled{{/noless}}{{#action}} formaction="{{action}}"{{/action}}>−</button><button type="submit" class="mrd-mas" name="{{name}}" value="{{more}}" aria-label="{{#str}} channel:later, local_oksigeniamarandu, {{more}} {{/str}}"{{#nomore}} disabled{{/nomore}}{{#action}} formaction="{{action}}"{{/action}}>+</button></span>
